  },
  {
   "number": 14,
   "direction": "down",
   "position": {
    "x": 10,
    "y": 5
   },
   "length": 10,
   "clue": {
    "text": "To describe something like \"not feeling good,\" you and I get to badly treat the rest of it!",
    "enumeration": "10"
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 15,
   "direction": "across",
   "position": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 6
   },
   "length": 8,
   "clue": {
    "text": "Often rounded up by the police, as one imagines.",
    "enumeration": "8"
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 15,
   "direction": "down",
   "position": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 6
   },
   "length": 9,
   "clue": {
    "text": "Worshiped by some as a favorite, it's not the \"holy\" type a onetime sportscaster often spouted.",
    "enumeration": "6,3",
    "separators": [
     {
      "at": 6,
      "mark": ","
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 16,
   "direction": "across",
   "position": {
    "x": 9,
    "y": 6
   },
   "length": 6,
   "clue": {
    "text": "A crystalline solid in back–for those who must have gone to school.",
    "enumeration": "6"
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 17,
   "direction": "down",
   "position": {
    "x": 8,
    "y": 7
   },
   "length": 8,
   "clue": {
    "text": "Sounds like a witticism of Oliver Wendell–but it's really just like house material.",
    "enumeration": "8"
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 18,
   "direction": "across",
   "position": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 8
   },
   "length": 6,
   "clue": {
    "text": "Women may wear such, like the Boston Strangler.",
    "enumeration": "6"
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 19,
   "direction": "down",
   "position": {
    "x": 2,
    "y": 8
   },
   "length": 7,
   "clue": {
    "text": "The spoken form has a lot of noise–with a number being first or second, for instance.",
    "enumeration": "7"
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 20,
   "direction": "across",
   "position": {
    "x": 7,
    "y": 8
   },
   "length": 8,
   "clue": {
    "text": "Most of what some write for the newspaper shows what the commuter may travel on. (But an early traveler was responsible for a place in five states!)",
    "enumeration": "8"
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 21,
   "direction": "down",
   "position": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 8
   },
   "length": 7,
   "clue": {
    "text": "\"Fab\" owl in English shows–this might be a knotty problem!",
    "enumeration": "7"
   }
  },
  {
   "number": 22,
   "direction": "down",
   "position": {
    "x": 6,
    "y": 9
   },
   "length": 6,
   "clue": {
    "text": "Makes an assertion in our country, being united.",
    "enumeration": "6"
   }
  },
  {
